xenomorphs-evolution-final-caste = This caste is the end of your evolutionary lineage.
ent-ActionXenomorphQueenHive = Manage hive
    .desc = Watch your sisters and appoint up to three leaders while attached to an ovipositor.
ent-ActionXenomorphQueenWord = Word of the Queen (50)
    .desc = Send a message to your hive.
ent-ActionXenomorphQueenOrder = Give order (100)
    .desc = Send an order to the sister you are watching.
ent-ActionXenomorphQueenPheromones = Pheromones (35)
    .desc = Emit frenzy, warding or recovery pheromones within 8 tiles. Costs 2.5 plasma per second.
xenomorph-evac-comms-error = ERROR: Communication between Central Command and the station is compromised
xenomorph-comms-hijack-evac-docked = The emergency shuttle has docked. We must reach the human fortress aboard a shuttle.
xenomorph-shuttle-hijack-rally = All xenos must gather to reach the distant human fortress! Find a shuttle and protect the Queen. On her ovipositor, she can seize its control console before the humans reach the fortress.
xenomorph-shuttle-hijack-verb = Invade the human fortress
xenomorph-shuttle-hijack-unavailable = The invasion window has not opened yet.
xenomorph-shuttle-hijack-window-lost = Too late, you missed the invasion window
xenomorph-shuttle-hijack-already-started = The hive is already on its way to the human fortress.
xenomorph-shuttle-hijack-requirements = Attach your ovipositor aboard a shuttle and use its nearby control console. The ship must not be travelling, and the emergency shuttle cannot be seized.
xenomorph-shuttle-hijack-departing = The shuttle is ours! We will reach the human fortress in three minutes. Prepare for the invasion!
xenomorph-shuttle-hijack-arrived = We have reached the human fortress! Advance for the hive!
ent-XenomorphHijackShuttleObjective = Invade the distant human fortress.
    .desc = Help the Queen seize a shuttle before the emergency shuttle reaches Central Command.

xenomorph-shuttle-hijack-channel = The Queen is taking control of the metal bird. Gather and protect her for two minutes!
xenomorph-shuttle-hijack-interrupted = Control of the metal bird has been interrupted!
xenomorph-invasion-unscheduled = Unscheduled shuttle departure detected from the operational area. Hijack likely. Shutting down autopilot.
xenomorph-invasion-general-quarters = ATTENTION! GENERAL QUARTERS. All Central Command personnel, man your battle stations. Prepare to repel boarders.
xenomorph-invasion-collision = EMERGENCY: SHUTTLE ON COLLISION COURSE WITH CENTRAL COMMAND. CRASH IMMINENT.
xenomorph-invasion-impact = IMPACT CONFIRMED. Multiple breaches in Central Command's perimeter. Hostile contacts inside the facility. All personnel, repel the invaders!
ent-CMUTileFire = fire
    .desc = A roaring fire.
